# Line endings are pinned here because nothing was pinning them.
#
# Until 2026-07-30 this repository had no .gitattributes and core.autocrlf
# false, so whatever a tool happened to write was what got committed: 138
# Python files in LF, 15 in CRLF, and three carrying both inside a single
# file. The cost was not cosmetic. An ordinary read-edit-write-back rewrite of
# main.py flipped the whole file and turned a 95-line change into 3,816
# insertions -- and because the text still compared equal, the round-trip
# check passed and nothing said a word.
#
# Two file types are deliberately NOT pinned below. They are absent on
# purpose, not by oversight:
#
#   *.json -- assistant/core/anchors_v1.json and anchors_v2.json are CRLF and
#             carry the anchor digests that published figures reproduce
#             against. Rewriting them to win a whitespace argument is not a
#             trade worth making.
#
#   *.bat  -- eleven launchers are LF and two are CRLF. cmd.exe is the only
#             consumer in this project that has ever been particular about
#             this, and an inconsistent launcher is a much better outcome
#             than a broken one.

*.py   text eol=lf
*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.cfg  text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf

# Named so a capsule, an icon or a model is never line-ending translated on
# the way in or out. machinesoul reconstructs bytes exactly or refuses, and a
# checkout that "helpfully" rewrote one would make it refuse.
*.png  binary
*.apng binary
*.gif  binary
*.webp binary
*.ico  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.gguf binary
*.onnx binary
*.wav  binary
*.zip  binary
*.pdf  binary
